WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Now, I want to point
something out to you Rory.

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.670
For most of this interview,

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.980
you've been looking sort
of slightly away from me.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.080
Yeah.
And I think it's probably

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.213
because of where your
camera is or something.

00:00:09.213 --> 00:00:10.690
Yeah.
But I'm telling you that

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.740
it makes you look untrustworthy.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.330
I--
For most of the interview,

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:18.220
you've been going, "I really
enjoy working with you Conan."

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.410
And it's that weird--
I--

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.017
Sociopathic--
I was reading the cue cards

00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:26.090
of the person you hired to come over here.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:28.350
You think I wanna say "hot stuff?"

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.110
I was told I had to say
that or the interview--

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:31.943
There's no cue card!

00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:32.776
Ends!

00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:34.237
There's no cue cards! I'm
over here! (snaps and yells)

00:00:34.237 --> 00:00:36.672
That's not even-- and
just for the listeners,

00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:38.700
that's not a real guitar.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.980
That's a green screen behind him.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.430
His basement is worse than mine.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.630
You're not looking at me!

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.720
Why are you not looking at me?!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.020
The Zoom thing is so hard to figure out!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.220
I wanna look at you--
No everyone else!

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:50.620
But then I'm looking up here!

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.280
I'm right here! Everyone
else is able to do it.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.113
Where?!
You--

00:00:54.113 --> 00:00:55.166
Conan?!

00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:56.500
(Conan laughs)

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.270
Where?! Conan?!

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.457
This is you the whole interview,

00:00:59.457 --> 00:01:02.120
"I uh, I want to tell you something Conan,

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.330
and I mean this from
the bottom of my heart."

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.470
What is that? What is that? What is that?

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.170
Well, I have the screen over here of you,

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.920
so I'm trying to see you

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:15.680
but I should be looking at
the camera that's up here

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.400
so then I can only sort of see--

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.183
Look, everyone watching this right now,

00:01:20.183 --> 00:01:22.090
they all know the Zoom deal.

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.260
If you don't know the Zoom
deal by now, what's going on?

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.610
You know the Zoom deal.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:28.360
You're over here. I gotta look here.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.049
It's not right. It's not right.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:34.730
OK, OK. Now listen to me.
We have a lot to talk about

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.490
and I'm glad to finally see your eyes.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.280
It's nice. You're a handsome fellow.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.550
You're a good looking guy.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:40.383
You mean that?

00:01:40.383 --> 00:01:43.760
Because I have not had a haircut
in about five months and--

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:47.060
Oh really? Because I'm getting
my hair cut constantly.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.050
You look good. You really do look good.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:50.970
You know what I find--

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.850
I guess I have to say that
without even looking over

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.580
to see if I truly believe it
cause I have to keep my eyes--

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.412
(Conan laughs)

00:01:57.412 --> 00:01:58.960
On this camera.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.054
Here's me seeing if I think it.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:03.790
(grunts) Yeah, I like it.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.320
You were like, "No, you
look good! Huh? Ew!"

00:02:07.378 --> 00:02:09.878
(Rory laughs)

